{"book":"kinney","chapter":"storybook","chapterTitle":"بناء أنظمة التصميم في Storybook","slug":"creating-an-icon-component","title":"إنشاء مكوّن أيقونة","headings":[],"html":"<p>لست متأكدًا من أننا سنفعل هذا معًا، لكني فكرت أن أريك تنفيذي الساذج جدًا لمكوّن <code>Icon</code>. أريد تحديد عدد الأيقونات المتاحة <em>و</em>أريد أن تساعدني الإكمال التلقائي في العثور على الأيقونة التي أحتاجها. وإليك مكوّن الأيقونة البسيط جدًا الذي يمكننا البدء به.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">LucideIcon</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AlertTriangle</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Check</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HelpCircle</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Info</span>,\n  X,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Zap</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ChevronDown</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Skull</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Star</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ExternalLink</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Heart</span>,\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;lucide-react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IconProps</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">LucideIcon</span>&gt; &amp; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>:\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;warning&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;check&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;help&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;info&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;x&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;zap&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;chevron&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;skull&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;star&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;external&#x27;</span>\n    | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;heart&#x27;</span>;\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">iconComponents</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Record</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IconProps</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;type&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">LucideIcon</span>&gt; = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">warning</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AlertTriangle</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">check</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Check</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">help</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HelpCircle</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">info</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Info</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">x</span>: X,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">zap</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Zap</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">chevron</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ChevronDown</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">skull</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Skull</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">star</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Star</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">external</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ExternalLink</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">heart</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Heart</span>,\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Icon</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span>, ...props }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IconProps</span></span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IconComponent</span> = iconComponents[<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span>];\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">IconComponent</span> {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props</span>} /&gt;</span></span>;\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> icons = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">keys</span>(iconComponents) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IconProps</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;type&#x27;</span>][];\n</code></pre>\n"}